    values:originalText "Without limiting the operation of the Fair Work Act 2009, Part 3-1 of that Act applies in relation to the making of a public interest disclosure by a public official who is, or has been, an employee (within the meaning of that Part) as if, for the purposes of that Act:  (a) this Act were a workplace law; and  (b) making that disclosure were a process or proceeding under a workplace law." ;
