concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30(4) Officers or employees of a contracted service provider"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, a Commonwealth contract does not include a grant covered by an instrument made under section 105C of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (instruments relating to grants). 31  Disagreements with government policies etc.  To avoid doubt, conduct is not disclosable conduct if it relates only to:  (a) a policy or proposed policy of the Commonwealth Government; or  (b) action that has been, is being, or is proposed to be, taken by:  (i) a Minister; or  (ii) the Speaker of the House of Representatives; or  (iii) the President of the Senate; or  (c) amounts, purposes or priorities of expenditure or proposed expenditure relating to such a policy or proposed policy, or such action or proposed action; with which a person disagrees." ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, a Commonwealth contract does not include a grant covered by an instrument made under section 105C of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (instruments relating to grants). 31  Disagreements with government policies etc.  To avoid doubt, conduct is not disclosable conduct if it relates only to:  (a) a policy or proposed policy of the Commonwealth Government; or  (b) action that has been, is being, or is proposed to be, taken by:  (i) a Minister; or  (ii) the Speaker of the House of Representatives; or  (iii) the President of the Senate; or  (c) amounts, purposes or priorities of expenditure or proposed expenditure relating to such a policy or proposed policy, or such action or proposed action; with which a person disagrees."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "84438e91bdd3337006e39a80f57194ff215c8711d9cbc8dd6f47f1263c76bd5e" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30 ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from disclosure of conduct related to government policies or actions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
