concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-32 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32 Conduct connected with courts or Commonwealth tribunals"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Despite section 29, conduct is not disclosable conduct if it is:  (a) conduct of a judicial officer; or  (b) conduct of:  (i) the chief executive officer of a court; or  (ii) a member of the staff of the chief executive officer of a court;" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Despite section 29, conduct is not disclosable conduct if it is:  (a) conduct of a judicial officer; or  (b) conduct of:  (i) the chief executive officer of a court; or  (ii) a member of the staff of the chief executive officer of a court;"@en ;
