doc:sec-50-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "50(2) Notification to discloser" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If paragraph (1)(b) applies, the principal officer must give written notice to the discloser of:  (a) the reasons for the decision; and  (b) if the principal officer has taken action, or proposes to take action, under section 50AA in relation to the referral of the conduct disclosed for investigation under another law or power—details of the following:  (i) the other law or power;  (ii) the agency or other person or body to which the conduct has been, or is to be, referred;  (iii) the steps taken, or proposed to be taken, for the conduct to be referred or to facilitate its referral." ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-50-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "50(3) Notification to discloser"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-50-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Despite paragraph (2)(a), the principal officer may delete from the reasons given to the discloser any reasons that would, if contained in a document, cause the document:  (a) to be exempt for the purposes of Part IV of the Freedom of Information Act 1982; or  (b) to have, or be required to have, a national security or other protective security classification; or   Investigations  Part 3 The obligation to investigate disclosures  Division 2  Section 50AA  Public Interest Disclosure Act 2013  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (c) to contain intelligence information." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Despite paragraph (2)(a), the principal officer may delete from the reasons given to the discloser any reasons that would, if contained in a document, cause the document:  (a) to be exempt for the purposes of Part IV of the Freedom of Information Act 1982; or  (b) to have, or be required to have, a national security or other protective security classification; or   Investigations  Part 3 The obligation to investigate disclosures  Division 2  Section 50AA  Public Interest Disclosure Act 2013  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (c) to contain intelligence information."@en ;
