concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-61 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "61 Additional obligations of public officials"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-61 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the principal officer of an agency in the conduct of an investigation under Division 2 of Part 3.  (2) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the Ombudsman in the performance of the Ombudsman’s functions under this Act.  (3) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the IGIS in the performance of the IGIS’s functions under this Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the principal officer of an agency in the conduct of an investigation under Division 2 of Part 3.  (2) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the Ombudsman in the performance of the Ombudsman’s functions under this Act.  (3) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the IGIS in the performance of the IGIS’s functions under this Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5dab60ad067c68d829faba802bda37fc84b22eaf1af5bf999f61f5f5393ea8ed" ;
    cof:pageNumber "89"^^xsd:integer ;
