    skos:definition "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:  (a) the disclosure or use is for the purpose of providing legal advice, or professional assistance, relating to a public interest disclosure (other than a legal practitioner disclosure) made, or proposed to be made, by the person who made the legal practitioner disclosure referred to in paragraph (1)(a); or  (b) the information has previously been lawfully published. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to a matter in subsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "499da35885690be7b5e82d2ccf80d75b0d9fdd5186e045b1c6bee48f4f3cb500" ;
