doc:sec-72-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "72(1) Meaning of prescribed authority" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Prescribed authority means one of following entities:  (a) a Commonwealth company;  (b) the part of the Defence Department known as the Australian Geospatial-Intelligence Organisation;  (c) the part of the Defence Department known as the Defence Intelligence Organisation;  (d) the High Court or any court created by the Parliament;  (e) a body that is:  (i) established by a law of the Commonwealth; and  (ii) prescribed by the PID rules;  (f) the person holding, or performing the duties of, an office that is:  (i) established by a law of the Commonwealth; and  (ii) prescribed by the PID rules." ;
    cof:pageNumber "102"^^xsd:integer .

concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-72-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "72(2) Meaning of prescribed authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-72-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The entities mentioned in paragraphs (b) and (c) of the definition of prescribed authority in subsection (1) are prescribed authorities   Administrative matters  Part 4 Officials and agencies  Division 3  Section 73  Public Interest Disclosure Act 2013  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  in their own right, and not in their capacities as part of the Defence Department. Subdivision C—Principal officers" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The entities mentioned in paragraphs (b) and (c) of the definition of prescribed authority in subsection (1) are prescribed authorities   Administrative matters  Part 4 Officials and agencies  Division 3  Section 73  Public Interest Disclosure Act 2013  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  in their own right, and not in their capacities as part of the Defence Department. Subdivision C—Principal officers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f7fd06058f9974096c063252ca1ec833c7cd2cf38b9b5f62889c044cd282a328" ;
    values:partOf concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-72 ;
