concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-82 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "82 Other investigative powers etc. not affected"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-82 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Act does not, by implication, limit the investigative powers conferred on an agency or a public official by a law of the Commonwealth other than this Act.  (2) This Act does not detract from any obligations imposed on an agency or a public official by a law of the Commonwealth other than this Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Act does not, by implication, limit the investigative powers conferred on an agency or a public official by a law of the Commonwealth other than this Act.  (2) This Act does not detract from any obligations imposed on an agency or a public official by a law of the Commonwealth other than this Act."@en ;
